msgid "Application info endpoint"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `quarkus-info` extension exposes an HTTP endpoint at `/q/info` that "
"returns information about the application: build metadata, git commit, Java "
"version, and operating system."
msgstr ""

msgid "Adding the extension"
msgstr ""

msgid "Add the `quarkus-info` extension to your project:"
msgstr ""

msgid "This will add the following to your build file:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Once added, start your application and access the info endpoint:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Response structure"
msgstr ""

msgid "The endpoint returns a JSON object with up to four sections:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Each section can be individually enabled or disabled via configuration."
msgstr ""

msgid "Git information modes"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `quarkus.info.git.mode` property controls how much git information is "
"included."
msgstr ""

msgid "`standard` (default)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Branch name, abbreviated commit ID, and commit time."
msgstr ""

msgid "`full`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Adds remote URL, tags, full commit ID, commit message, author and committer "
"details."
msgstr ""

