msgstr ""

msgid "Custom info contributors"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can contribute your own sections to the info endpoint by implementing "
"the `InfoContributor` interface and making it a CDI bean:"
msgstr ""

msgid "This adds a `custom` section to the info endpoint response:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `name()` method determines the key in the JSON output.\n"
"The `data()` method is called once at startup, use it for values that don't "
"change at runtime."
msgstr ""

msgid "Programmatic access"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The extension also exposes injectable beans that you can use directly in "
"your code:"
msgstr ""

msgid "The available beans are:"
msgstr ""

msgid "`GitInfo`: `branch()`, `latestCommitId()`, `commitTime()`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"`BuildInfo`: `group()`, `artifact()`, `version()`, `time()`, "
"`quarkusVersion()`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`JavaInfo`: `version()`, `vendor()`, `vendorVersion()`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`OsInfo`: `name()`, `version()`, `architecture()`"
msgstr ""

msgid "Management interface"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you use the xref:management-interface-reference.adoc[management "
